{"path":"string/multibyte/wctob","title":"std::wctob","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>wctob","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/multibyte/wctob","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Narrows a wide character c if its multibyte character equivalent in the initial shift state is a single byte.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cwchar\">&lt;cwchar&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> wctob<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide\"><span class=\"kw3619\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wint_t</span></span></a> c <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Narrows a wide character <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c</span></code> if its multibyte character equivalent in the initial shift state is a single byte.\n</p><p>This is typically possible for the characters from the ASCII character set, since most multibyte encodings (such as UTF-8) use single bytes to encode those characters.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> c\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> wide character to narrow\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c\">EOF</a></span> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c</span></code> does not represent a multibyte character with length <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code> in initial shift state.\n</p><p>Otherwise, the single-byte representation of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c</span></code> as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span></code> converted to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;clocale&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cwchar&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> try_narrowing<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span> c<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> cn <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">wctob</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>cn <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c\"><span class=\"kw1898\">EOF</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\'</span>'</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"' narrowed to \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span>cn <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">else</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\'</span>'</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"' could not be narrowed<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/setlocale\"><span class=\"kw2006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setlocale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/LC_categories\"><span class=\"kw2009\">LC_ALL</span></a>, <span class=\"st0\">\"th_TH.utf8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/hex\"><span class=\"kw1798\">std::<span class=\"me2\">hex</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/showbase\"><span class=\"kw1782\">std::<span class=\"me2\">showbase</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"In Thai UTF-8 locale:<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    try_narrowing<span class=\"br0\">(</span>L<span class=\"st0\">'a'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    try_narrowing<span class=\"br0\">(</span>L<span class=\"st0\">'๛'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/setlocale\"><span class=\"kw2006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setlocale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/LC_categories\"><span class=\"kw2009\">LC_ALL</span></a>, <span class=\"st0\">\"th_TH.tis620\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"In Thai TIS-620 locale:<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    try_narrowing<span class=\"br0\">(</span>L<span class=\"st0\">'a'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    try_narrowing<span class=\"br0\">(</span>L<span class=\"st0\">'๛'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>In Thai UTF-8 locale:\n'0x61' narrowed to 0x61\n'0xe5b' could not be narrowed\nIn Thai TIS-620 locale:\n'0x61' narrowed to 0x61\n'0xe5b' narrowed to 0xfb</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/multibyte/btowc\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>btowc</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  widens a single-byte narrow character to wide character, if possible <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/narrow\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>narrow</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  narrows characters <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_ios&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/ctype/narrow\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>narrow</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes <code>do_narrow</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::ctype&lt;CharT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/string/multibyte/wctob\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>wctob</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/multibyte","title":"Null-terminated multibyte strings"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::wctob","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Narrows a wide character c if its multibyte character equivalent in the initial shift state is a single byte."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"c"},{"label":"Return value","note":"EOF if c does not represent a multibyte character with length 1 in initial shift state."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"btowc","note":"widens a single-byte narrow character to wide character, if possible"},{"label":"narrow","note":"narrows characters"},{"label":"narrow","note":"invokes do_narrow"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":225,"codeBlockCount":2}
